  "title": "Product Constellation",
  "tagline": "Reweave the drifted worlds into one clear journey.",
  "heroConcept": "From the neck down: soft heather-gray knit overshirt over white tee, canvas work apron with pencil loops and stitched patches, dark tapered denim, clean white sneakers, woven friendship band and simple field watch"
 },
