 "story": {
  "bossIntro": "The Silo shudders awake: a tangled mass of half-shipped features hissing, Ship separately! Never together!",
  "defeat": [
   "Even thoughtful builds hit dead ends. You, Chris, will re-sketch and try again."
  ],
  "intro": [
   "You are Chris. The product worlds have drifted apart and the user journey is scattered like stars.",
   "With Prototype Pencil in hand and Launch Loop ready, you step into the labyrinth to reconnect them."
  ],
  "levelIntros": [
   "Create Atelier: Easels float untethered and drafts pile up. Find Clarity and pin the loose ideas down.",
   "Discover Arcade: The Creator Market buzzes but no one can find anyone. Follow Utility to relight the path.",
   "Conversation Core: Families and developers call across gaps. Earn Trust to bridge to the Connection Core."
  ],
  "victory": [
   "The Silo unravels into tidy threads and the worlds click back into a single constellation.",
   "Creators, families, developers and small shops cheer as the journey flows again. Well shipped, Chris!"
  ]
 },
